{
  "label": "Score",
  "inputs": {
    "criteria": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "candidates": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "scores": {
      "kind": "json",
      "binding": {
        "op": {
          "kind": "function",
          "functionRef": "op.member",
          "input": {
            "value": {
              "kind": "json",
              "binding": {
                "op": {
                  "kind": "function",
                  "functionRef": "op.member",
                  "input": {
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "json",
                      "binding": {
                        "op": {
                          "kind": "function",
                          "functionRef": "context.get",
                          "input": {
                            "name": {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "binding": {
                                "text": "operation"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "output": {
                            "name": "value",
                            "kind": "json"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "prop": {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "binding": {
                        "text": "output"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "output": {
                    "name": "value",
                    "kind": "json"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "prop": {
              "kind": "text",
              "binding": {
                "text": "scores"
              }
            }
          },
          "output": {
            "name": "value",
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "scores"
    }
  },
  "operation": {
    "kind": "prompt",
    "user": "Score every candidate against every criterion.\n\n## The criteria\n\n{{.inputs.criteria}}\n\n## The candidates\n\n{{.inputs.candidates}}\n\n## How to score\n\n- Every candidate against **every** criterion. A blank cell is a score of zero\n  wearing a disguise.\n- Score 0..1 per criterion, then `total` as the weighted sum. Do the arithmetic;\n  do not eyeball it.\n- Say **why** in a sentence per cell where the score is not obvious. A table of\n  bare numbers cannot be argued with, which means it cannot be trusted.\n- Score the candidate as written, not the candidate you would have written.\n- The mandatory candidate is scored on the same criteria as everything else. If\n  it wins, it wins.\n\n## The column that matters most\n\nPer candidate, `unique`: **the one thing no other candidate does.** Not its best\nfeature — the thing that would be lost if it were dropped. This is what\n`synthesize` reads to build a composite, and a candidate whose `unique` is empty\nis a candidate that was never really different.\n\n## What to produce\n\n`scores` — one row per candidate: `candidate_id`, `criterion_scores` (per\ncriterion: the name, the score, and the why), `total`, and `unique`.\n",
    "config": {
      "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5"
    },
    "input": {},
    "output": {
      "name": "output",
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "scores": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "candidate_id",
                "criterion_scores",
                "total"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "candidate_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "criterion_scores": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object"
                  }
                },
                "total": {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                "unique": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "The one thing no other candidate does."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "scores"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
